sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen as Citizen (User)
    participant Ctrl as RecyclersDiscoveryController
    participant Svc as GeoMatchingService
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext (PostgreSQL)
    participant MW as GlobalExceptionMiddleware

    Note over Citizen,MW: UC U-05 (Phan 2): XEM HO SO CONG KHAI, GIO MO CUA & BANG GIA NIEM YET CUA CO SO TREN BAN DO

    Citizen->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/recyclers/{recyclerId}?lat=10.7769&lng=106.7009
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetRecyclerPublicDetailAsync(recyclerId, lat, lng, ct)

    Svc->>DB: SELECT RecyclerProfile + User + Prices(Status = Active) + WasteCategory<br/>WHERE UserId = recyclerId AND VerificationStatus = Verified AND User.Status = Active

    alt Co so khong ton tai, chua duoc Staff duyet (Pending/Rejected) hoac tai khoan bi khoa (BR-MTH-01, BR-MTH-06)
        DB-->>Svc: null
        Svc-->>MW: throw NotFoundException ("Khong tim thay co so thu mua hoac co so chua duoc phe duyet.")
        MW-->>Citizen: 404 Not Found (ApiResponse.Fail: MSG-NOT-FOUND)
    else Co so hop le va da duoc phe duyet (Verified)
        DB-->>Svc: RecyclerProfile + Active Prices (PriceStatus.Active)
        alt Co truyen toa do nguoi dung (lat != 0 || lng != 0)
            Svc->>Svc: Tinh DistanceKm = Round(CalculateDistanceKm(userLat, userLng, profile.Lat, profile.Lng), 2) (BR-MTH-05)
        else Khong truyen toa do
            Svc->>Svc: DistanceKm = 0.0
        end
        Svc->>Svc: MapProfileToPartnerDto (FacilityName, Address, OperatingHours, ContactPhone, Active Materials)
        Svc-->>Ctrl: CollectionPartnerDto
        Ctrl-->>Citizen: 200 OK (ApiResponse.Ok: MSG-GEN-01 - Lay thong tin co so thu mua thanh cong)
    end

